# Run A (user 2026-11-05): the online-freeze fine-tune with the TRUNK FROZEN for the
# whole run -- one change from il_finetune_c0_freeze.env (job 463472).
#
# 463472 held policy= ~0.83 through its 1000 critic-only updates, then collapsed
# within ~165 updates of the unfreeze (0.67, and 0.02 by 87k steps). Here the
# encoder, action embedding and GRU never train; only the actor head, the critic
# heads and the temperature do. If driving holds, the collapse was the critic's
# gradients reshaping the features the steering reads.
. "$REPO/slurm/il_finetune_c0_freeze.env"
export IL_FREEZE_TRUNK=1
